# API by default; leave blank for a same-origin production API.
# Set the actual HTTPS origin before a cross-origin production build.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
# Development only: log in with mock launch tokens instead of the SONO bridge. Works only against a
# backend running its mock profile; a production backend refuses them. Never set it for a release.
# VITE_API_TEST_MOCK_AUTH=1
# Offline design review remains available at ?mode=mock and ?screens=1.
# Never place core credentials, PINs, signing secrets or tokens in VITE_* variables.
